      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STEAL THE STAGE (8) is generally an honest type in the frame at five of 14 starts but missed the placings last time when sixth (25.65) over 450m at Shepparton. Has a good record here including three wins. Boxed wide but will go close with the right run. LEKTRA SKIP (1) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Finished in the minors last time when second (34.67) at Sandown making it back to back placings. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Will give a great sight again. BORACAY BELLA (7) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for two wins and three minors. In the money last time at this track (34.53) in a Restricted WIN H, finishing a 3 length second. Looks a key chance on best figures. ASTON MACHINE (5) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
